            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.5.2

- Friends fold up to one line each, with a little meter per account showing how much room they have left. Click a name to open the full table again, or use Open all / Fold all.
- Drag friends up and down to put them in the order you want.
- The checkboxes at the bottom (Launch at login, Hide 5-hour, Include my account emails) now work when you click the box itself, not just the words.
]]></description>
