            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.5

- **Connect iPhone** on My devices: shows a QR code for the Bagel Meter iPhone app, which then shows what this Mac sees (your accounts, friends and computers). Your Mac sends it encrypted every 10 minutes while it's awake. No logins ever leave the Mac.
]]></description>
